	(text "Sensor port J5 (TF-Luna): 5V, SCL, SDA, GND.\nCharging port J7: battery, GND, SDA, SCL, power good, charge status, charge disable.\nLanding sensor port J8: 5V, SCL, SDA, GND, same as J5.\nRadio port J6: 5V, TX (GPIO2), RX (GPIO10), GND. It shares the\nESC CUR and TLM pins: use the ESC signals or the radio, not both."
